  m_text: 'How to play: : You''ll spawn into an open world game... Look around, WASD
    as well as arrow keys work. The goal of this game is to firgue out the truth
    while collecting clues and exploring. You have a guide called EESUIA, they will
    help you on your adventure. When you click on the shop your arrow might disappear,
    click Esc and click the shop again. Consider this payment from what I took from
    you. Signed: #############'
